// Pixel art as data: one character per pixel, '.' is clear, every other
// character is a palette key. Authored with a scratch generator, then
// committed as plain grids: edit the rows here directly.
//
// 4-boss, the cable-stayed bridge at morning: the arena on its deck. Same
// layout as the rooftop set so the chunk baker works unchanged: tiles are
// 16 x 16, anchor top left, each kind one anim whose frames are variants
// (fps 0, pick by column hash). roofTop is the deck: rows 0 to 3 the
// asphalt (row 0 the lit curb edge), row 4 its lip, rows 5 to 10 the painted
// steel edge girder with its bolts, rows 11 to 15 the shadow under the deck
// (variant 1 a white lane dash, variant 2 a steel expansion joint with a
// puddle holding the sky); roofEdgeLeft and roofEdgeRight its ends with a
// steel end plate; roofFill the steel under the deck in shadow (variant 1
// an X brace, variant 2 a bolted splice plate; weight the plain one
// heaviest); oneWay a maintenance catwalk grating on brackets; stone a
// concrete pier block; spikes a torn expansion joint, steel fingers bent up
// over hazard paint; brick a roadworks crate with hazard stripes
// (breakable); auraBlock the sigma crate in a steel frame; vent a deck drain
// (matches roofFill); pipe the crash barrier, a W beam rail on posts, run
// sideways (tileable).
//
// Decor anchor is the bottom left. cableAnchor (16 x 24): a stay's anchor
// box at the deck edge; the stay leaves the sprite's top at (12, 0)
// heading (2, -7): to show it running on up to its tower, draw a 3 px line
// in the stay colours (B C D) on from there off the top of the view.
// bridgeLamp (16 x 48): a slim deck light still faintly on in the morning,
// its lamp at (11, 10), a red aviation lamp at (6, 7). arenaGate (32 x 48,
// the checkpoint at the arena door): striped posts, a beam, a hanging sign
// with a big handprint; 2 frames of the amber beacons blinking in turn
// (2 fps, loop), beacons at (3, 5) and (26, 5). bossBar (96 x 8): the frame
// of the boss health bar, a gorilla icon on its left; ZAKIM_BOSS_BAR_INNER
// is the trough to fill (left to right, with the hp fraction).
//
// CABLE: the bridge's stays she and the gorilla climb in phase 3, 16 x 16,
// anchor top left like the tiles. rise runs from the bottom left corner to
// the top right; fall from the top left to the bottom right. Each has 3
// variants (fps 0): 0 the run, 1 the low end (a steel socket on the deck),
// 2 the high end (a clamp). The walkable top is the lit sheath on the
// diagonal through the cell's corners (x + y = 13 to 14 for rise), the
// strand's dark underside at x + y = 17; a dark collar marks every joint.
// Lay a run as cells stepping one up and one across.
//
// ZAKIM_GLOW lists the keys that glow: F G the lamp, I J amber beacons,
// K L red, ^ ~ the aura sigma.
//
// ZAKIM_BACKDROP: three 512 px tileable strips for the parallax, bottom on
// the horizon (the bottom row is one colour, so it can be lifted), sky
// left clear for the morning preset. far (96): the city waking in the haze,
// the boxy tower with its crown and mast (a red light) and the tall mirror
// glass slab taking the sky, a gold dome on a brick house, warm blocks with
// sun glints in their windows, steam off the roofs. mid (128): the bridge's
// two inverted Y towers (legs straddling the deck, a single shaft, an
// obelisk tip with a red light) at x 128 and 384, their stays fanned to the
// deck on both sides, the far deck along the bottom. near (96): stays close
// up, a tent of cables rising from anchor boxes on the far rail to a tower
// top far above the middle of the strip, the far guard rail at the bottom.
